  "title": "Cheesy Vegetable Soup II",
  "description": "Canned condensed cheese soup and cheddar or Colby cheeses are used in this soup with carrots, mushrooms, corn, peas and broccoli florets.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Shulka"
  ],
